{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.rotmg\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">rotmg</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d1 </span><span class=\"fn\">d2 </span><span class=\"fn\">x1 </span><span class=\"fn\">y1</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`rotmg d1 d2 x1 y1` constructs the modified rotation `H` that zeros the second component of\n`(√d1 * x1, √d2 * y1)`, step for step as the reference `srotmg`.\n\nThe reference writes only the entries of `DPARAM` that the flag says `rotm` reads, and leaves the\nothers as they were; here those entries hold the values the flag implies (`H` is the identity for\nflag `-2`). The reference also leaves `DH11` and `DH22` unset on the flag `0` path, and `DH21` and\n`DH12` on the flag `1` path, until a rescaling writes them; those are not read either. Where the\nreference loops forever on an infinite `d1` or `d2`, this stops after `Rotmg.fuel` steps.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.rotmg","kind":"def","line":286,"name":"BLAS.Float32.rotmg","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L286-L334"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.instReprRotmg\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprRotmg</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Repr.html#Repr\">Repr</a> <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.instReprRotmg","kind":"instance","line":283,"name":"BLAS.Float32.instReprRotmg","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L283-L283"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.instReprRotmg.repr\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprRotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">repr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Format/Basic.html#Std.Format\">Std.Format</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.instReprRotmg.repr","kind":"def","line":283,"name":"BLAS.Float32.instReprRotmg.repr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L283-L283"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.instInhabitedRotmg\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedRotmg</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.instInhabitedRotmg","kind":"instance","line":283,"name":"BLAS.Float32.instInhabitedRotmg","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L283-L283"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.x1\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">x1</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.x1","kind":"def","line":282,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.x1","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L282-L282"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.d2\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">d2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.d2","kind":"def","line":281,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.d2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L281-L281"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.d1\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">d1</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.d1","kind":"def","line":280,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.d1","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L280-L280"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.param\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">param</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">Rotmg</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam\">RotmParam</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.param","kind":"def","line":279,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.param","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L279-L279"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.mk\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam\">BLAS.Float32.RotmParam</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\">BLAS.Float32.Rotmg</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.mk","kind":"ctor","line":276,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L276-L283"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The result of `rotmg d1 d2 x1 y1`: the parameter of the modified rotation and the new `d1`,\n`d2`, `x1`, which the reference `srotmg` returns in its arguments.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg","kind":"structure","line":276,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L276-L283"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.fuel\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">fuel</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The fuel of `scale1` and `scale2`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.fuel","kind":"def","line":271,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.fuel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L271-L272"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.scale2\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">scale2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a> → <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The reference's `DO WHILE` loop that brings `|d2|` into `(rgamsq, gamsq)`, with fuel as in\n`scale1`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.scale2","kind":"def","line":258,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.scale2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L258-L269"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.scale1\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">scale1</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a> → <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The reference's `DO WHILE` loop that brings `d1` into `(rgamsq, gamsq)`, with fuel: a finite\nnonzero `d1` takes at most 46 steps, while for an infinite `d1` the reference loops forever and\nthis stops when the fuel runs out.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.scale1","kind":"def","line":240,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.scale1","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L240-L256"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.expand\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">expand</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Before a rescaling step, the reference writes out the entries implied by flags `0` and `1` and\nsets the flag to `-1`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.expand","kind":"def","line":233,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.expand","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L233-L238"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.zero\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">zero</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The reference's reset when the rotation does not exist: flag `-1`, `H = 0`, `d1 = d2 = x1 = 0`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.zero","kind":"def","line":227,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.zero","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L227-L231"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.x1\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">x1</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.x1","kind":"def","line":225,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.x1","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L225-L225"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Rotmg.State.d2\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Rotmg</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">d2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BL