2a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L104-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam.mk\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">RotmParam</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam\">BLAS.Float32.RotmParam</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam.mk","kind":"ctor","line":92,"name":"BLAS.Float32.RotmParam.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L92-L109"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">RotmParam</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The parameter of a modified rotation, the reference `DPARAM` array: `flag` is `DPARAM(1)` and\n`h11`, `h21`, `h12`, `h22` are `DPARAM(2)` to `DPARAM(5)`, the entries of `H = [h11 h12; h21 h22]`.\n\nThe flag tells which entries `rotm` reads:\n* `-2`: `H` is the identity and no entry is read;\n* `-1`: all four entries are read;\n* `0`: `h11 = h22 = 1` are implied, only `h21` and `h12` are read;\n* any other value (`1` from `rotmg`, or NaN): `h21 = -1` and `h12 = 1` are implied, only `h11` and\n  `h22` are read.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.RotmParam","kind":"structure","line":92,"name":"BLAS.Float32.RotmParam","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Rot.lean#L92-L109"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.getElem_rot_snd\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Vec</span>.<span class=\"name\">getElem_rot_snd</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c </span><span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Vec.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Rot.html#BLAS.Float32.Vec.rot\">rot</a> <span class=\"fn\">c</span> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a><